@@ -1,5 +1,28 @@
 # Changelog
 
+## [v0.1.43-test.1] - 2026-11-27
+
+> R56 strict IP-literal validation for AirPlay endpoint candidates. This prevents hostnames and malformed numeric strings from being treated as receiver IP addresses; it does not claim to fix the E2LB vehicle startup failure.
+
+### English
+- Replace the permissive dotted-string IPv4 check with strict four-octet decimal validation (0..255); reject DNS names, malformed octets, ambiguous leading-zero forms and IPv4 strings with scopes.
+- Replace prefix-only IPv6 detection with strict IPv6 literal parsing, including single-compression validation, exact group counts, IPv4-embedded tails and validated ASCII interface scopes.
+- Classify IPv6 link-local addresses using the actual `fe80::/10` prefix after successful parsing.
+- Ensure endpoint candidate ordering, unspecified-address detection and `/64` network checks operate only on valid IP literals and never perform DNS lookups.
+- Add regressions for hostnames passing the previous IPv4 heuristic, out-of-range octets, malformed IPv6 compression, invalid scopes, IPv4-mapped IPv6, and the `fe80::/10` boundary.
+- Focused exact-source tests: 19 passed; deterministic property checks: 25,000 generated IPv4 literals, 25,000 generated IPv6 literals and 100,000 arbitrary strings without parser exceptions. Full Android Gradle build and real-vehicle behavior remain unverified.
+
+### 简体中文
+- 将宽松的点分字符串 IPv4 判断替换为严格四段十进制校验（每段 0..255）；拒绝 DNS 域名、非法数字段、有歧义的前导零形式及带 scope 的 IPv4。
+- 将仅检查冒号的 IPv6 判断替换为严格字面量解析，校验唯一压缩段、准确组数、IPv4 嵌入尾段及合法 ASCII 网卡 scope。
+- IPv6 链路本地判断改为在地址解析成功后按真实 `fe80::/10` 前缀判断。
+- 端点候选排序、未指定地址判断及 `/64` 网络校验只接受合法 IP 字面量，不执行 DNS 查询。
+- 新增域名误判、IPv4 越界、IPv6 多重压缩、非法 scope、IPv4-mapped IPv6 及 `fe80::/10` 边界回归测试。
+- 精确源码聚焦测试 19 项通过；确定性属性检查覆盖 25,000 个 IPv4、25,000 个 IPv6 和 100,000 个任意字符串，未出现解析异常。完整 Android Gradle 编译及实车行为仍未验证。
+
+Full changes / 完整变更: [v0.1.42-test.1...v0.1.43-test.1](https://github.com/1092679281/Android-/compare/v0.1.42-test.1...v0.1.43-test.1)
+
+
 ## [v0.1.42-test.1] - 2026-11-27
 
 > R55 strict CSM TLV parsing for 0x4301 and 0x5703 endpoint data. This is parser hardening, not evidence of a vehicle connection fix.
